    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11138" root="خفق" body-key="x">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَخْفَقٌ</span></b>  <i>A place,</i> (TA,) or <i>a level land,</i> (As,
TA,) <i>in which the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَرَاب</span> [or <i>mirage</i>] <i>quivers.</i>
(As, TA.) [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خِفْقَةٌ</span>.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And [the pl.]
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَخَافِقُ</span> signifies The <i>places of setting</i> [of stars]:
and is used as [a sing.,] meaning the <i>place of
setting</i> of a star. (Ham p. 152.) [See also
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَافِقٌ</span>.]

